    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c761743536e07ab1c8b88d79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你确定要找的人是我吗？\n我不是菱亚马逊也不是凯斯奇迹，是菱钻奇宝喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3046c4bfe57aa15230439af4a468b54c7a0e1bb2704238961883da06275700",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5dd562d6a5384a69bb6b05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要找的就是菱钻奇宝。\n我告诉她没有认错人，而是看了影片后觉得在意才来的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a983c7a7efcda0e727db0153133b2a3d3ed8172c4a640e09ca5165d4204912",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:913b5abae19209e09b2cbaeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，然后我也看过了你的战绩……",
