      "uid": "zhcn:f573175fab1779cfc81d6f5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "影片……？啊～确实有拍过……应该吧？\n不过我明明没有说出自己的名字……你特地调查过了吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db389e71e0b32671189542203550b663241bda75791fed3a7959dca6c1f87f1",
