    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79fa91b943ed06367938b2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱钻奇宝在选拔赛、模拟赛以及多项目竞技大赛等\n所谓“考验真正实力的场合”中，都持续败北。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b220828ade1a1d63705407e7c601864fb39554e935b4d968f20cbaaa080f75d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
