      "uid": "zhcn:e2bb85513ce6eaa02124852a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但是看着她轻盈地奔跑离去的背影时，我突然想起来。\n明明才刚并跑练习完──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc226861cbc54a04fa444a1721f3625d583594d8ab491267ec2ba729b30c48c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
